  "description": "BMOC (Big Man On Campus) takes on an entirely new meaning with the Worksman Big Bones™, BMOC Cruiser Bicycle. This is the Bicycle designed for the Big and Tall Man. With our unique Big Bones 22” frame, this is the Worksman for riders over 6’2” with a minimum inseam of 32\". The Big Bones frame is carefully designed with oversized steel frame tubing tapered at the ends to fit the famous Worksman lug set. The Big Bones BMOC has a totally new look and is built Worksman tough. Naturally the bike is equipped with renowned WTC 26x2.125 Clincher rims, 11 gauge spokes, and other features which have made Worksman the “GO TO” Brand for heavy duty cycles since 1898. The base model is rated for a 275 lb rider . With tire, tube, front brake, sealed crank set, solid seatpost and pedal upgrades, this \"beast\" is appropriate for riders up to 450 lbs and a true \"beauty\" as well. Image shown includes upgrades including rear fender, front Drum Brake and 3 speed. HAVE IT YOUR WAY, by selecting the options just right for your needs.",
